#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:1
msgid "Abundance"
msgstr "丰度"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:3
msgid ""
"`sme.abund` stores elemental abundances, while `sme.monh` stores the "
"global metallicity offset. In PySME, these two are combined at synthesis "
"time."
msgstr ""
"`sme.abund` 保存元素丰度，而 `sme.monh` 保存整体金属丰度偏移量。在 PySME 中，这两者会在合成时组合使用。"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:6
msgid "Core rule in PySME"
msgstr "PySME 中的核心规则"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:8
msgid "For elements heavier than He, the abundance used by SMElib is:"
msgstr "对于比 He 更重的元素，SMElib 实际使用的丰度为："

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:14
msgid "Hydrogen and helium are not shifted by `monh`."
msgstr "氢和氦不会受到 `monh` 的平移影响。"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:16
msgid "What this means when you modify abundances"
msgstr "当你修改丰度时，这意味着什么"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:18
msgid ""
"When you update one element in `sme.abund`, you are writing the "
"**pattern** value (before the global metallicity shift).   So if you want"
" a target final abundance `A_target` (for example in `H=12`), use:"
msgstr ""
"当你更新 `sme.abund` 中某个元素时，你写入的是 **pattern** 值（即整体金属丰度平移之前的值）。因此，如果你想得到目标最终丰度 "
"`A_target`（例如采用 `H=12` 标度），应使用："

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:26
msgid "then assign that pattern value."
msgstr "然后把这个 pattern 值写入即可。"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:29
msgid ""
"Note that when printing out `abund`, `monh` is applied to the abundance "
"values."
msgstr "注意，在打印 `abund` 时，`monh` 已经被应用到丰度值上。"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:32
msgid "Practical examples"
msgstr "实际示例"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:41
msgid "1. Set a target absolute abundance (H=12)"
msgstr "1. 设置目标绝对丰度（H=12 标度）"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:43
msgid "If you want final `A(Mg) = 7.40`:"
msgstr "如果你希望最终 `A(Mg) = 7.40`："

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:50
msgid ""
"Because PySME adds `monh` later, this produces the intended final Mg "
"abundance."
msgstr "由于 PySME 会在后续再加上 `monh`，这样就会得到你希望的最终 Mg 丰度。"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:52
msgid "2. Keep scaled-solar composition, only change metallicity"
msgstr "2. 保持 scaled-solar 组成，只修改金属丰度"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:58
msgid ""
"This shifts all metals (Z > 2) together by `-0.50 dex`, while keeping "
"abundance ratios fixed."
msgstr "这会让所有金属元素（Z > 2）整体平移 `-0.50 dex`，同时保持丰度比不变。"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:60
msgid "3. Set an element enhancement at fixed metallicity"
msgstr "3. 在固定金属丰度下设置某个元素增强"

#: ../../fundamentals/abund.md:62
msgid ""
"If you want `[Mg/Fe] = +0.30` at current `monh`, add `+0.30` to Mg in the"
" pattern relative to your base pattern."
msgstr ""
"如果你希望在当前 `monh` 下满足 `[Mg/Fe] = +0.30`，就在你的基准 pattern 上，对 Mg 增加 `+0.30`。"
